,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/18","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/18","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/18/labels","id":9444736,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AkB2A","number":18,"title":"4.2","description":"","creator":{"login":"aaronfranke","id":1646875,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDY4NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1646875?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronfranke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":1,"closed_issues":3110,"state":"closed","created_at":"2023-05-26T01:52:24Z","updated_at":"2026-10-02T22:43:13Z","due_on":"2023-11-30T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2023-11-30T08:36:57Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-08-27T21:51:51Z","updated_at":"2025-08-28T03:17:22Z","closed_at":"2025-08-28T02:59:50Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110036","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110036","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110036.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110036.patch","merged_at":"2025-08-28T02:59:50Z"},"body":"PR #97510 consolidated the Vulkan includes into a lightweight `godot_vulkan.h` header. This was cherry-picked to older branches, but there was a mistake when cherry-picking to 4.2, this one spot was missed. This PR fixes it.\r\n\r\nThe file being included, `#include \"drivers/vulkan/godot_vulkan.h\"`, is very similar to the existing code already, but adds `#include <stdint.h>` and `#define VK_NO_STDINT_H`:\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\n#ifndef GODOT_VULKAN_H\r\n#define GODOT_VULKAN_H\r\n\r\n#ifdef USE_VOLK\r\n#include <volk.h>\r\n#else\r\n#include <stdint.h>\r\n#define VK_NO_STDINT_H\r\n#include <vulkan/vulkan.h>\r\n#endif\r\n\r\n#endif // GODOT_VULKAN_H\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis problem **only affects 4.2**, not 4.3 or later, and not 4.1. In the 4.1 branch, the code already matches the contents of this PR: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/4.1/drivers/vulkan/vulkan_context.h\r\n\r\nWithout this PR, the iOS platform does not compile in the 4.2 branch with the latest Xcode. With this PR, it compiles.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110036/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110036/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}